<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#CCITTGroup3> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "CCITT T.4 (Group 3) facsimile coding, one- or two-dimensional as bit 0 of options (the T4Options tag) says, each row after an EOL code unless noEol, decoded with libtiff's recovery rules; the reference line carries across strips in the session."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#CCITTGroup3> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Use as a controlled value or grouping in this register. Profiles bind the appropriate scheme and map their raw wire codes to concept IRIs; membership does not prescribe a wire code. Codec/algorithm concepts require any applicable variant, framing and parameter information from the profile."@en .
