<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#LZW> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Lempel-Ziv-Welch coding with a 12-bit dictionary. The parameter variant names the framing; this version defines \"tiff\": TIFF 6.0 section 13, codes most significant bit first, Clear 256 and EndOfInformation 257, and the early change to a wider code one entry before the dictionary fills."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#LZW> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Use as a controlled value or grouping in this register. Profiles bind the appropriate scheme and map their raw wire codes to concept IRIs; membership does not prescribe a wire code. Codec/algorithm concepts require any applicable variant, framing and parameter information from the profile."@en .
